## Install Miniconda3
Download installer:

```bash
wget http://repo.continuum.io/miniconda/Miniconda3-latest-Linux-armv7l.sh
```

Verify and install:

```bash
sudo md5sum Miniconda3-py39_4.12.0-Linux-aarch64.sh
sudo /bin/bash Miniconda3-py39_4.12.0-Linux-aarch64.sh
```

Set install location to:

```text
/home/pi/miniconda3
```

Update `.bashrc`:

```bash
sudo nano /home/pi/.bashrc
```

Add:

```bash
export PATH="/home/pi/miniconda3/bin:$PATH"
```

Then save, exit, and verify:

```bash
python --version
```

